}

### POST /api/channels/{channelKey}/simulate — channels.simulate
POST {{host}}/api/channels/{{channelKey}}/simulate
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "candidate_id": 1,
    "contact": "Example contact",
    "text": "Example text"
}
